id: EVT6-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: generation_keep
target: crates/core/src/session.rs
find:     state.run.generation = settle_generation(rule, was_busy, gen_before, state.run.generation);
replace:     state.run.generation = gen_before.next().unwrap_or(gen_before);
expect-fail: keep_on_accept
expect-fail: keep_on_refuse
expect-fail: keep_on_confirm_achieve
expect-fail: keep_on_save
expect-fail: p2_keep_ops_never_change_generation
note: 関門を通さず、どの操作の後も世代を 1 つ増やす（Keep の操作で世代が動く）
